{"5431570":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"High T","steam_appid":5431570,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The city is only the beginning<\/h2>High T is a single-player, top-down action sandbox with a 90s arcade attitude. Create your action hero, explore the city, search buildings for supplies and take the wheel. Cause enough trouble and the police will come looking.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One hundred floors. Earn every staircase.<\/h2>Cuck Tower turns the action into a climb for survival. Clear each floor, collect the final enemy's key and unlock the next staircase. Take one pistol or revolver through the first security checkpoint, then rebuild your arsenal as you climb. Ammunition carries between floors, so every magazine matters.<br><br>Fight through changing room layouts, electrified water, fire and gas. Face a boss every ten floors, from charging bruisers to snipers and shielded enforcers, before the final confrontation at the top.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your tools<\/h2>Switch between melee weapons, sidearms and heavier guns. Find shotguns, rifles, an Uzi, a flamethrower and a grenade launcher. Scavenge matching ammunition, throw grenades and use vehicles to navigate the streets.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make the run yours<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Customize your hero's hair, clothing, eye color and face style.<br><\/li><li>Choose from four difficulty modes when starting a run.<br><\/li><li>Play with keyboard and mouse or controller, including menu navigation.<br><\/li><li>Adjust the HUD size and optional aim assist, and toggle the CRT effect.<br><\/li><li>Save locally, with automatic saves when moving between tower floors.<\/li><\/ul><br>Rain-soaked streets, detailed pixel illustrations and a curved, scanlined CRT presentation set the scene. The climb tracks your score and elapsed time. Reaching the roof is only part of the story.","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The city is only the beginning<\/h2>High T is a single-player, top-down action sandbox with a 90s arcade attitude. Create your action hero, explore the city, search buildings for supplies and take the wheel. Cause enough trouble and the police will come looking.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One hundred floors. Earn every staircase.<\/h2>Cuck Tower turns the action into a climb for survival. Clear each floor, collect the final enemy's key and unlock the next staircase. Take one pistol or revolver through the first security checkpoint, then rebuild your arsenal as you climb. Ammunition carries between floors, so every magazine matters.<br><br>Fight through changing room layouts, electrified water, fire and gas. Face a boss every ten floors, from charging bruisers to snipers and shielded enforcers, before the final confrontation at the top.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your tools<\/h2>Switch between melee weapons, sidearms and heavier guns. Find shotguns, rifles, an Uzi, a flamethrower and a grenade launcher. Scavenge matching ammunition, throw grenades and use vehicles to navigate the streets.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make the run yours<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Customize your hero's hair, clothing, eye color and face style.<br><\/li><li>Choose from four difficulty modes when starting a run.<br><\/li><li>Play with keyboard and mouse or controller, including menu navigation.<br><\/li><li>Adjust the HUD size and optional aim assist, and toggle the CRT effect.<br><\/li><li>Save locally, with automatic saves when moving between tower floors.<\/li><\/ul><br>Rain-soaked streets, detailed pixel illustrations and a curved, scanlined CRT presentation set the scene. The climb tracks your score and elapsed time. Reaching the roof is only part of the story.","short_description":"Own the streets. Survive the climb. High T is a top-down action sandbox with a 100-floor combat tower, escalating weapons, dangerous hazards and ten bosses. Build your action hero, take the wheel and fight through a city wrapped in a heavy 90s CRT glow.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5431570\/44e0be747060f55a207dceade6f5b6e9ccf5042a\/header.jpg?t=1793702698","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5431570\/40d66e38c8db8f43bd5795eed9e53287299c0bf7\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793702698","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5431570\/40d66e38c8db8f43bd5795eed9e53287299c0bf7\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793702698","website":"https:\/\/firebird.gg\/invite\/25C32D28","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 \/ Windows 11 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 64-bit x86 processor with SSE4.2 support<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> OpenGL 3.3-compatible graphics card and driver<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Provisional requirements; final hardware validation pending. <\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"developers":["Werb"],"publishers":["Werbly"],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":499,"final":299,"discount_percent":40,"initial_formatted":"$4.99","final_formatted":"$2.99"},"packages":[1874725],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy High T","description":"","selection_text":"Select a pur